|CKBMage|000

|CK0Mages are adaptable spellcasters who turn research, repeated field use,
runes, and specialized equipment into increasingly refined magic. Their range
includes direct damage, defense, control, travel, detection, and recovery.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Combat and useful casting earn Arcane progress. Each working advances from
Copied through Instinctive mastery, reducing costs and opening rune sockets.
Practiced combat workings can become automatic barrages, while FOCUS weapons
and AURA equipment create a battlemage path alongside ordinary casting.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0mshard and missile provide early attacks; analyze and detect reveal
information; protection, stasis, phase, and gate control danger and movement;
recollection restores spell power; inscribe and runes customize mastered
workings.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Mage if you enjoy a large spellbook, long-term mastery, build
customization, and deciding whether each fight calls for a cast, a barrage,
control, or utility.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBmagehelp|CK0, |CKBspellbook|CK0, |CKBspells|CK0, and
|CKBresearch|CK0 to explore the full system.|000

